<!DOCTYPE html>
 <html lang="en">
 <head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>College Student Hub</title>
  <style>
   body {
    font-family: sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    color: #333;
   }

   header {
    background-color: #007bff;
    color: white;
    padding: 1em 0;
    text-align: center;
   }

   nav {
    background-color: #343a40;
    color: white;
    padding: 0.5em 0;
    text-align: center;
   }

   nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.7em 1.5em;
    display: inline-block;
   }

   nav a:hover {
    background-color: #555;
   }

   .container {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
   }

   .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2em 0;
   }

   .hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
    color: #007bff;
   }

   .hero p {
    font-size: 1.1em;
    color: #666;
   }

   .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.8em;
    color: #333;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #007bff;
    padding-bottom: 0.5em;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
   }

   .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
   }

   .feature-card {
    background-color: #e9ecef;
    padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 6px;
   }

   .feature-card h3 {
    color: #007bff;
    margin-top: 0;
   }

   .feature-card p {
    color: #555;
   }

   footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1em 0;
    background-color: #343a40;
    color: white;
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 100%;
   }

   /* Styles for Review Section */
   .review-card {
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
   }

   .review-author {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
   }

   .review-text {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #555;
   }

   /* Styles for Placement Guide Section */
   .placement-guide-item {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
   }

   .placement-guide-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #007bff;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
   }

   .placement-guide-description {
    color: #333;
   }
  </style>
 </head>
 <body>
  <header>
   <h1>Welcome to the College Hub</h1>
  </header>

  <nav>
   <a href="#">Home</a>
   <a href="#">Academics</a>
   <a href="#">Clubs & Activities</a>
   <a href="#">Resources</a>
   <a href="#">Contact</a>
   <a href="#">Reviews</a>
   <a href="#">Placement Guide</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="container">
   <section class="hero">
    <h1>Connecting Students, Empowering Futures</h1>
    <p>Your central platform for all things college life.</p>
    </section>

   <section>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Explore Our Features</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
     <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Course Information</h3>
      <p>Access details about your courses, syllabus, and important dates.</p>
     </div>
     <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Student Clubs</h3>
      <p>Discover and join various clubs and organizations on campus.</p>
     </div>
     <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Study Resources</h3>
      <p>Find helpful materials, notes, and links to academic resources.</p>
     </div>
     <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Events Calendar</h3>
      <p>Stay updated on upcoming college events, workshops, and seminars.</p>
     </div>
     <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Discussion Forums</h3>
      <p>Connect with fellow students and discuss course-related topics.</p>
     </div>
     <div class="feature-card">
      <h3>Important Announcements</h3>
      <p>Get the latest news and announcements from the college administration.</p>
     </div>
    </div>
   </section>

   <section>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Student Reviews</h2>
    <div class="review-card">
     <p class="review-author">John </p>
     <p class="review-text">"This college has a great learning environment and supportive faculty."</p>
    </div>
    <div class="review-card">
     <p class="review-author">Jane </p>
     <p class="review-text">"I really appreciate the resources available to students here."</p>
    </div>
    </section>

   <section>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Placement Guide</h2>
    <div class="placement-guide-item">
     <h3 class="placement-guide-title">Resume Writing Tips</h3>
     <p class="placement-guide-description">Learn how to create a compelling resume that stands out to employers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="placement-guide-item">
     <h3 class="placement-guide-title">Interview Preparation</h3>
     <p class="placement-guide-description">Get ready for your interviews with these helpful tips and strategies.</p>
    </div>
    </section>

   <section>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Get Involved</h2>
    <p>Explore the vibrant community and numerous opportunities available at our college. Join a club, attend an event, and make the most of your college experience!</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer>
   <p>&copy; 2025 College Student Hub</p>
  </footer>
 </body>
 </html>
